    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75476" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρχηδόν</span></b> , Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρχος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in a row,
